  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 3a</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="3a" corresp="#wit-g-a">Bete man ærest þone griðbryce into þære cyrican, be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be þam þe ðære cyricean mæð sy.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="3a" corresp="#wit-a">Bete man arost þonne gryðbryce into þare cyrican, be þam þe syo dæde sy ⁊ be þam þe þare cyricean mæð sy.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="3a" corresp="#wit-q">Emendetur prius (primitus) infractio pacis in ipsam ęcclesiam, iuxta quod culpa fuerit et ipsius ęcclesię dignitas;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="3a" corresp="#wit-g-a">Bete man ærest þone griðbryce into þære cyrican be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be þam þe ðære cyricean mæð sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-g-a">In the first instance, amends for breach of its protection shall be made to the church, in accordance with the nature of the offence and also in proportion to the status of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">büsse er zuerst an die [verletzte] Kirche den Bruch des Sonderfriedens, je nachdem die Missethat ist, und je nachdem der Rang dieser Kirche ist.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">let compensation first be paid to the [violated] church for the breach of protection, according to what the deed is and according to the rank of the church.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="283"><ref target="clause:VIIIAtr_4">VIII Atr 4</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 4,</note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VIII Atr 4.1.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
